-- WORLD CAN'T BE CREATED --------------------------------------- main.kl  K1501

I can't let this code construct or decode a `World`. Only `main` receives the `World`, so every power a program has can be traced back to it.

2│     let root = World()
                  ^^^^^^^

Help: Take the capability you need as a parameter (`net: Net`, `fs: Fs`), and pass it down from `main`.

Learn more: kalam explain K1501
